#: ../../source/docs/common-horizon31-pixc4-jetson.rst:9
#: 129b9a27c873462caaf20348d0eff9cd
msgid ""
"The PixC4-Jetson is a professional-quality and NDAA Compliant Flight "
"Management Unit (FMU), powerful single board computer and peripheral support"
" system (USB, MIPI, Ethernet, M.2 slot, etc.) in a small form factor, "
"designed to be integrated into end-user platforms. The term “PixC4” is "
"derived from the Pixhawk, on which the FMU design is based (FMUv5) and C4, "
"representing Command, Control, Compute and Communication."
msgstr ""
"PixC4-Jetson 是一款专业级、符合 NDAA "
"规定的飞行管理单元（FMU），集成了强大的单板计算机和外设支持系统（USB、MIPI、以太网、M.2 "
"插槽等），采用小型化设计，专为集成到终端用户平台而设计。「PixC4」 名称源自 Pixhawk（FMU 设计基于 FMUv5）和 "
"C4，代表指挥（Command）、控制（Control）、计算（Compute）和通信（Communication）。"

